{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/4662", "subject": "Re: 觉得《勇敢的心》娇柔煽情的举手！！", "body": "fight, and you may die. run, and you\\'ll live, for at least a while, and die in your beds many years from now. would your be willing to trade, for one chance, just one changce! to come back here and tell our enemies, that they may take our lives, but they would never take our freedom.\n然后是战斗的吼叫。\nps：玩魔兽冰封王座的兽族的战役的时候，有一幕中驯兽师也发出了类似的战斗的怒吼。\n: 至今仍然有点印象的，也就是男主人公给大家做动员的那段\n: 当时挺佩服他的组织和鼓动能力的", "from": "tang <tang@ccert.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
