{"id": "spam_sa::sa::spam_2::01188.67d69a8d6e5c899914556488c8cbd2c9", "subject": "你在尋找機會嗎??打開來看看", "body": "<!-- saved from url=(0022)http://internet.e-mail -->\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=big5\">\r\n<meta name=\"GENERATOR\" content=\"Microsoft FrontPage 5.0\">\r\n<meta name=\"ProgId\" content=\"FrontPage.Editor.Document\">\r\n<title>新網頁1</title>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<!-- saved from url=(0022)http://internet.e-mail -->\r\n<p><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff00\"><font size=\"7\">職 場 快 報</font></span></p>\r\n<p><font size=\"3\">二十一世紀的明日之星</font></p>\r\n<p><font color=\"#FF0000\" size=\"7\"><marquee bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" width=\"573\">★親 旺 連 鎖 超 商★</marquee></font></p>\r\n<font size=\"2\">\r\n<p>在一片不景氣中，日用品市場仍一枝獨秀。無論是在海內外，</p>\r\n<p>皆是一樣。經濟學者預估，日用品市場仍是主宰經濟大軸。</p>\r\n</font>\r\n<p><b>一份付出，一生關懷</b></p>\r\n<p><font face=\"Arial Unicode MS\" size=\"4\" color=\"#0033CC\"><b><span style=\"background-color: #FFFF66\">聯合消費,共享回饋,輕鬆加盟,備受尊榮</span></b></font></p>\r\n<font size=\"2\">\r\n<p>的經營理念。可說是目前連鎖超商中的一顆明亮之星。</p>\r\n<p>為了拓展業務，我們成立網路行銷特訓專業課程</font><font size=\"3\"><b>,<a href=\"http://gto.h8h.com.tw/網路特訓/特訓首頁.htm\">歡迎您來投入</a></b></font></p>\r\n<font size=\"2\">\r\n<p>教育做到標準化、制度做到合理化，並以傳銷及傳統連鎖超商雙方面行銷</p>\r\n<p>【這是一個充滿愛與希望的事業，歡迎您的加入。】</p>\r\n</font>\r\n<p><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ff99ff\"><font size=\"4\">經濟困難者，但能力強、有衝勁。一起合作共同成長。</font></span></p>\r\n<p><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #00ffff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \r\n詳情請洽:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://gto.h8h.com.tw/\"> 陳店長</a></span></font></p>   \r\n<p>　<form action=\"mailto:gto82gto82@seed.net.tw?subject=想瞭解加盟通路事業\" encType=\"text/plain\" method=\"post\" <p></p>   \r\n  <p align=\"left\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: -2px; MARGIN-TOP: -2px\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" face=\"新細明體\" size=\"4\">請勾選您是否需要我們<span>免費的創業光碟</span></font></b></p> \r\n  <p align=\"left\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 6px; MARGIN-TOP: 6px\"><b><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"華康細圓體(P)\" size=\"4\"><input name=\"我要索取免費的創業光碟\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"ON\">  \r\n  </font><span><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"新細明體\" size=\"4\">我要索取免費的創業光碟&nbsp;</font></span></b></p> \r\n  <table border=\"1\" cellSpacing=\"1\" height=\"1\" width=\"687\"> \r\n    <tbody> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"20\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">中文姓名</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"20\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><input name=\"中文姓名\" size=\"14\"></font><font color=\"#ff0000\">(請填中文全名)</font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">聯絡電話 : 大哥大</font></b></p> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">住家</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3px; MARGIN-TOP: 3px\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><input name=\"聯絡電話-白天\" size=\"14\"></font><font color=\"#ff0000\">(必填欄位)</font> \r\n          <p align=\"left\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3px; MARGIN-TOP: 3px\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><input name=\"聯絡電話-住家\" size=\"14\"></font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"24\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">地址</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"24\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><input name=\"地址\" size=\"40\"></font><font color=\"#ff0000\">(必填欄位)</font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">最方便面談時間</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"最方便面談時間\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>星期一</option> \r\n            <option>星期二</option> \r\n            <option>星期三</option> \r\n            <option>星期四</option> \r\n            <option>星期五</option> \r\n            <option>都可以</option> \r\n            <option>假日</option> \r\n          </select></font><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" size=\"2\">晚上7:30-9:00&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">年齡</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><input name=\"年齡\" size=\"4\"></font><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" size=\"2\">歲(須18歲以上)&nbsp;</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">性別</font></b></td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"性別\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>男</option> \r\n            <option>女</option> \r\n          </select>&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" size=\"3\">職業</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"職業\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option>\r\n            <option>內勤上班族</option>\r\n            <option>業務行銷</option>\r\n            <option>SOHO族</option>\r\n            <option>自己當老板</option>\r\n            <option>職業婦女</option>\r\n            <option>家庭主婦</option>\r\n            <option>待業中</option>\r\n            <option>學生</option>\r\n            <option>其他</option>\r\n          </select>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">其它</font></b><font color=\"#ffff00\">  \r\n          <input name=\"職業其它\" size=\"14\"></font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" size=\"3\">星座</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"星座\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>牡羊座</option> \r\n            <option>金牛座</option> \r\n            <option>雙子座</option> \r\n            <option>巨蟹座</option> \r\n            <option>獅子座</option> \r\n            <option>處女座</option> \r\n            <option>天枰座</option> \r\n            <option>天蠍座</option> \r\n            <option>射手座</option> \r\n            <option>摩羯座</option> \r\n            <option>水瓶座</option> \r\n            <option>雙魚座</option> \r\n          </select></font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\" size=\"3\">婚姻狀況</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"婚姻狀況\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>未婚</option> \r\n            <option>已婚</option> \r\n          </select>&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">兼職動機</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"兼差動機\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>錢不夠用</option> \r\n            <option>增加第二份收入</option> \r\n            <option>創業當老板</option> \r\n            <option>就是想賺錢</option> \r\n          </select></font></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n      </tr> \r\n      <tr> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"484\"> \r\n          <p align=\"right\"><b><font color=\"#cc66ff\">最方便聯絡時間</font></b></p> \r\n        </td> \r\n        <td align=\"right\" borderColorLight=\"#808080\" height=\"1\" width=\"733\"> \r\n          <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#ffff00\"><select name=\"最方便聯絡時間-星期\" size=\"1\"> \r\n            <option selected>請選擇</option> \r\n            <option>星期一</option> \r\n            <option>星期二</option> \r\n            <option>星期三</option> \r\n            <option>星期四</option> \r\n            <option>星期五</option> \r\n            <option>星期六</option> \r\n            <option>星期日</option> \r\n            <option>都可以</option> \r\n         