{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/7395", "subject": "=?gb2312?B?UmU6INPWysdQtPPSu7XjysKjrM7KzsqwyaOsztK+zcrHz+uyu82o1eLW1tf2t6ijrMfrv6q1vM7S", "body": "0rs=?=\nTo: shen@ccert.edu.cn\nFrom: Tran Quang Anh <ni@cernet.edu.cn>\nContent-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary=\"----------=_1096893220-996-410\"\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nX-UIDL: pMK!![ch!!%NB!!k6'\"!\n\n��������]\n��������mm��������������������������\n������������������������������������\n: ��������������,����������������������������,��������������������,������������������,����������,����?\n: ������������QQ��������mm��������������������������������~��������������������\n: ����������������������������������������������������������������������\n: ...................", "from": "", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/2679", "subject": "Re: [TOEFL] 关于315和923的系网问题", "body": "☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   NDD (贞德:誓死打退英国人的侵略) 于  (Fri Jul  8 02:58:23 2005)  提到:\n兴奋死了\n天天睡不着觉,哈哈哈\n盼着攻打他的那天早点来临!\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   earthfly (尘土飞扬) 于  (Fri Jul  8 03:00:23 2005)  提到:\n呵呵，悠着点儿，小伙子，别弄出人命来！\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   bluesquirrel (棉花糖||没文化真可怕……) 于  (Fri Jul  8 03:01:02 2005)  提到:\n……冷静\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   singlehero (我是蚂蚁) 于  (Fri Jul  8 03:04:07 2005)  提到:\n一定要灭了他\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   billythomas (disenchanted) 于  (Fri Jul  8 04:24:46 2005)  提到:\n呵呵，估摸着是被别人先灭了。\n我被人灭的时候，对方新找的老婆还护得紧呢，也不肯告诉。即使说明了肯定不去骚扰也不行，除非愿意一起吃饭承认自己被灭了。不过后来，哪有不透风的墙.....还附带听了不少八卦.....\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   NDD (贞德:誓死打退英国人的侵略) 于  (Fri Jul  8 04:38:42 2005)  提到:\nen en\n所以上次出席同学婚礼的时候\n他们出现的时候\n我就直接退席\n根本就不顾那么多了\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   billythomas (disenchanted) 于  (Fri Jul  8 04:55:09 2005)  提到:\n小伙子不错，是个男人就要这么干。\n不过这样的女人就算了，不要再去搞了。\n后面好的多得是。\n这不，不到两个月就找了个更好的。否则套在上面那个上，多亏啊。\n想想当初她那样，好像跟拣了个宝贝似的。\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   FOXYANG (秀一) 于  (Fri Jul  8 07:04:00 2005)  提到:\n唉................\n☆─────────────────────────────────────☆\n   billythomas (disenchanted) 于  (Fri Jul  8 07:10:19 2005)  提到:\n确实，这叫什么事啊。", "from": "Shaozhi Ye <yana@compass.net.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::0873.bd6a6b2911a0dedccee495aaf0fb248d", "subject": "RE: A moment of silence for the First Amendment (fwd)", "body": "> The problem is that politics have gotten so muddied\n> nowadays, that shouting down and unpeaceably disrupting\n> political rallies that you don't agree with has become\n> common practice.  The courts have constantly ruled\n> that there are some restrictions on the first amendment.\n> They teach you that your very first year of law school.\n>\n\nI don't think politics is any muddier. People are becoming increasingly\nunethical. It's a breakdown in home training.\n\nBill", "from": "Bill Stoddard <bill@wstoddard.com>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/4635", "subject": "● 法国电信北京研发中心招聘", "body": "1. Senior speech processing expert/specialist  in Chinese Speech Synthesis \n( TTS - Text to Speech ) (1 ) ()\nQualifications: \n1. Ph.D or experienced Master degree in Speech Synthesis R&amp;D in the top university or top research institute in China or international. \n2. has the deep background on TTS, and know the system clearly,  be able to lead a team in TTS R&amp;D.\n3. With creative idea in research and with high level paper published or patent application. \n4. good programming skill in C/C++ , perl, matlab etc in Linux OS \n5. Team spirit and open mind. \n5. Fluent English. \nEmail: ytung@francetelecom.com.cn\n2. Speech processing expert in Chinese speech recognition or speaker \nrecognition (1 ) ()\nQualifications:\n1. Ph.D or experienced Master degree in speech recognition in the top university or top research institute in China or international.\n2. With creative idea in research and with high level paper published or patent application.\n3. good programming skill in C/C++ , perl, matlab etc in Linux OS\n4. Team spirit and open mind.\n5. Fluent English.\nEmail: ytung@francetelecom.com.cn \n\n", "from": "pan <pan@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
