{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::0565.881770e64b20fa8ee779d12aeda1fc54", "subject": "earthviewer apps Re: whoa", "body": "Gary Lawrence Murphy cynicizes:\n> Hmmm, just as I thought.  In other words, it has no practical uses\n> whatsoever ;) \n\nTourism is the world's largest industry. Using this\nto preview your travels, or figure out where you are,\nwould be very valuable.\n\nOnline gaming continues to grow. Screw \"Britannia\", \nreal-life Britain would be a fun world to wander/\nconquer/explore virtually, in role-playing or real-\ntime-strategy games.\n\nAnd of course, as James Rogers points out, it's an\nideal display substrate for all sorts of other \noverlaid data. Maps are great, photrealistic 3-D\nmaps of everywhere which can have many other static \nand dynamic datasets overlaid are spectacular. \n\n(Combining those last two thoughts: consider the\nstatic world map, in faded colors, with patches\nhere-and-there covered by live webcams, stitched\nover the static info in bright colors... it'd be\nlike the \"fog of war\" view in games like Warcraft,\nover the real world.)\n\n- Gordon", "from": "Gordon Mohr <gojomo@usa.net>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/741", "subject": "Re: RE: [TOEFL] skype", "body": "1. 我不是表白自己善良，但是我觉得lg不管不问的态度是害了他侄女，25岁年纪不小了，女孩子最好的光阴没有几年的。她学历不高，工资不多，还没有户口，父母收入很少，将来养活自己养活父母都是问题。我只是让她自己也考虑到这些问题。\n2. 之前我和lg说过这些，他不愿和侄女沟通，我也不想做坏人的，但我现在让她有压力对她将来应该有好处的。她心里恨我我也无所谓的。\n3. 我说的都是些小事，车票衬衫……，可是有几个人大奸大恶的，为人处事不都是小事反应出来的，她早晚要独立的，在社会上还有谁会容忍她，\n4. 我承认自己对表弟比对lg侄女要有感情，所以我才会怕lg和侄女觉得我厚此薄彼，在心力与物质上我对侄女付出的要多很多。\n5. 我气的不是lg侄女，是lg的态度，说句无情的话他侄女不懂事没出息终归是别人孩子，于我何干，但自己lg负担不起他侄女的前途，还不及时给点忠告。和他沟通，他总是敷衍，到头来害自己害别人。\n人人都有人性的弱点，家家都有难念的经！\n自己不够精明，处理不好这些，失望ing，对自己对lg。\n谢谢大家了！同情or拍砖er。", "from": "you <you@ns.6test.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
