{"id": "spam_sa::sa::spam_2::00801.00fc164b0d3eabfded6c0dc24050dbb1", "subject": "Your Paycheck!", "body": "<html>\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=windows-1252\">\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n<table cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"475\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000000\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"275\">\n        <p align=\"left\"><br>\n        <i><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Arial\" size=\"5\">Work From Home Resources&nbsp;</font></i></p>\n      </td>\n      <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"200\" height=\"88\">\n        <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"http://gif.national-adv.com/corner8c.jpeg\" align=\"right\" hspace=\"2\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"143\" height=\"86\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"402\" bgcolor=\"#999966\" rowspan=\"3\">&nbsp;\n        <p><b>We are desperately need responsible, dependable people through the\n        United States to fill full and part time positions working from their\n        home <u><font size=\"4\">making $500-$1250 a week!</font></u></b></p>\n        <p><b>Benefits:</b></p>\n        <ul>\n          <li><b>Set your own schedule</b></li>\n          <li><b>Spend more time with your </b><b>family</b></li>\n          <li><b>No more long commute</b></li>\n          <li><b>Make more money!</b></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p><b>If you have computer and internet access and can work\n        unsupervised, this is the opportunity for you!</b></p>\n        <p><b>Click here to feel out our free application and we will get you\n        started today!</b></p>\n        <p><b>We will even give you a <font color=\"#FF0000\" size=\"4\"> FREE VACATION</font> to enjoy just for visiting\n        filling out our free application today.</b></p>\n        <p><b>Don't wait, positions have already closed in 13 states.</b></p>\n        <p align=\"center\"><b><font size=\"5\"><a href=\"http://optin.national-adv.com/moym/\">Apply today for Free 