{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::0914.77308dfba976d8491bad00bb7e616166", "subject": "Re: Polit-spam", "body": "----- Original Message -----\nFrom: \"Gary Lawrence Murphy\" <garym@canada.com>\n\n>\n> >>>>> \"w\" == wpin  <lslifriend> writes:\n>\n>     w> Those who want to leave for the Netherlands to carry on any\n>     w> kind of education,including for PHD, must be careful\n>     w> . Especially the university of Groningen(RUG) should be\n>     w> avoided. This university was once a good one but now it has\n>     w> lost its reputation. ... Studying is a good investment in time\n>     w> and money. So invest in the right place and time. You are\n>     w> warned.\n\nDear gawd - 'lost its reputation' - how horrible for those Northern\nEuropeans. What could possibly be worse than that?", "from": "\"Mr. FoRK\" <fork_list@hotmail.com>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/6216", "subject": "Re: 看看这道面试题怎么样？", "body": "假设队伍的速度为V1，传号兵的速度为V2，显然有V2 &gt; V1\n1）传号兵从队尾走到队头，设所花时间为T1，以队伍为参考系，传号兵的速度为V2 - V1\n       则  （V2 - V1）* T1 = 100 \n       解得： T1 = 100 / （V2 - V1）\n2）传号兵从队头走到队尾，设所花时间为T2，以队伍为参考系，传号兵的速度为V2 + V1\n       则  （V2 + V1）* T2 = 100 \n       解得： T2 = 100 / （V2 + V1）\n再以队伍为研究对象，速度为V1，总时间为 T1 + T2 ，行走路程为100，故有\n        V1 * [100/（V2 - V1）+ 100/（V2 + V1）] = 100\n整理得：V2*V2 - 2*V1*V2 - V1*V1 = 0\n        解得：V2 = （1 + sqrt(2)）* V1\n由于二者所花时间相同，所以传号兵走的路程是队伍的 1 + sqrt(2) 倍\n即： （1 + sqrt(2)）* 100", "from": "xu <xu@tsinghua.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
