{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::1202.f08961f34260e8c17e28d788641f21c5", "subject": "Re: New testing packages", "body": "BTW: I just a found a quite nice looking apt repositry for all kinds of\naudio apps at\n\nhttp://ccrma-www.stanford.edu/planetccrma/software/\n\nPeter\n\n\nOn Thu, 2002-09-19 at 23:28, Angles Puglisi wrote:\n> Matthias Saou (matthias@rpmforge.net) wrote*:\n> >- I've rebuilt a new \"alsaplayer\" package based on Angle's one.\n> \n> Cool, one less package to maintain :)\n> \n> One interesting thing about alsaplayer is that RedHat's XMMS package in RH8 will\n> probably not play mp3 files. But alsaplayer does play mp3s \"out of the box\".\n> \n> Also, they are developing rapidly in their CVS and looks like their next version\n> of alsaplaer will be pretty cool, but I have no idea when it will be ready.\n> \n> --\n> That's \"angle\" as in geometry.\n> \n> \n> \n> _______________________________________________\n> RPM-List mailing list <RPM-List@freshrpms.net>\n> http://lists.freshrpms.net/mailman/listinfo/rpm-list\n\n\n\n\n_______________________________________________\nRPM-List mailing list <RPM-List@freshrpms.net>\nhttp://lists.freshrpms.net/mailman/listinfo/rpm-list", "from": "Peter Peltonen <peter.peltonen@iki.fi>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/4748", "subject": "Re: 我还用等待么？", "body": "分了吧！这么说有点残忍，但是跟你有过同样的经历\n坚持下去很痛苦的\n因为从你的措辞来看，你对他不是很满意\n人是很难改变的，尤其是改变成另一个人希望的样子\n我跟你有过比较相同的经历\n坚持下去很痛苦\n和适合你的人在一起很幸福\n你不用很累得去改变一个人\n他也不用很累得去为一个人改变\n顺其自然最好\n: 看了你的描述和别人的回复\n: 总觉得不太对劲\n: 其实你遇到的可能就是很正常的那种社会上常说的木讷的潜力股，以不解风情著称的极有潜力的博士为代表的人吧，呵呵。不是经常有人在女友、瑞丽、青年文摘什么的杂志上发这种文章么，而且貌似千篇一律是工作女vs校园男，呵呵。\n: ...................", "from": "Shaozhi Ye <wua@compass.net.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
