{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/5688", "subject": "Re: 终于恢复了往日的繁荣！！！！！！！！！！！！", "body": "20号人以下没戏啊\n咱们还是先酝酿一下的吧\n: 标  题: Re: 终于恢复了往日的繁荣！！！！！！！！！！！！\n: 发信站: 水木社区 (Tue Jul 19 19:44:06 2005), 站内\n: \n: 坑王还是挖一两个好坑吧，这里许久没有上十大了\n: \n: : 吭吭吭\n: \n: \n: --\n:     在上世纪初，还不存在米兰德比这个字样。那时只有个叫\"米兰板球与足球\"\n: 的俱乐部，就是现在的AC米兰。但是在1908年3月9日的这一天，一些从米兰俱乐\n: 部脱离出来的球员组建了\"国际米兰足球俱乐部\"。\n:     俱乐部名称来源于这群创立者的初衷，就是允许同时吸纳外国球员和意大利\n: 球员，“国际”一词的含义也在于此。\n: ---\n: \n: \n: ※ 来源:・水木社区 newsmth.net・[FROM: 59.66.114.*]", "from": "you <you@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::1454.88f9d20d76cccc7f1bde4e4d0794b69d", "subject": "Re: [SAdev] 2.40: ready for release?", "body": "Justin Mason wrote:\n\n> What do you all think?  are we ready to go?  anyone run into any trouble\n> with the new autoconf code, or found a bug from the merge of that spamc\n\nI am now preparing a small patch to configure.in for NetBSD (possibly\nalso useful for Open- and FreeBSD, don't know). Should be ready and\ntested in the next half hour.\n\nIf you think 2.40 is ready, I would suggest to wait just 24 hours more\nfor possible reports by b2_4_0 users. Not everyone can follow the\ndevelopment during daytime (at work).\n\n\nciao\n     Klaus\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nThis sf.net email is sponsored by: Jabber - The world's fastest growing \nreal-time communications platform! Don't just IM. Build it in! \nhttp://www.jabber.com/osdn/xim\n_______________________________________________\nSpamassassin-devel mailing list\nSpamassassin-devel@lists.sourceforge.net\nhttps://lists.sourceforge.net/lists/listinfo/spamassassin-devel", "from": "Klaus Heinz <k.heinz.aug.zwei@onlinehome.de>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
