ated ability to build/maintain influential, consultative relationships with clients \nExpertise/experience in workforce-related areas \nAbility to look beyond the daily HR transactions to Understand the business, Recognize organizational trends and needs and Influence leaders in addressing those issues \nHandle multiple simultaneous tasks. \nEmail:weibin.chen@bearingpoint.com", "from": "feng <feng@ccert.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
