{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/spam/5030", "subject": "办证件", "body": "尊敬的客户:\n您好,为方便企、事业单位本公司长期承办以下业务：如果您需要,请联系我们；如果您暂时不需要，请保留联系方式；如果打扰了您，敬请谅解，谢谢！\n\n\n1、\t\n代办各地学校原版毕业证、专科、本科带学士学位、研究生带硕士学位、MBA、国外大学本科、专科毕业证书和CET-4、CET-6、专业英语等级证书、PETS、WSK、日语等级证书、雅思、托福等证书、各省市自学考函授、中专、计算机等级证，并为客户提供档案材料。\n\n2、\t\n代办微软(MCSE、MCDBA、MCP)、思科（CCNA、CCNP）(两天出成绩,四周拿证书)、SUN、ORACLE、LINUX认证、ADOBE（ACCD）、CCNIC、3DMAX、3COM、JAVA证书、软件工程师证书、程序员证、物流师、剑桥英语证书、PMP证书、IPMP证书、ISO内审员证书、注册审核员证、医师（护士）执业证书、医师（护士）资格证、律师证书及执业证书、导游证、操作证、会计证、会计师资格证、CPA证、各种评估师证、注册监理师证、项目经理证、装饰行业资格证书、ICDA、国家信息化技术考试证书、国家网络技术考试等级证书、地产证、房产证、工程师证等。\n\n3、\t\n代办公司营业执照手续（营业执照、税务登记证、组织机构代码证、公章、财务章等），同时代开发票业务等。\n\n4、\t代办各省市驾驶证、行驶证、附加费、养路费、代理各种车牌等重要材料。\n\n5、\t\n代办港澳通行证（多次往返或单程证）、出国护照（转换身份）和代办各国签证（留学、探亲、商务、移民）以及为出国人员提供相关材料(学历及成绩公证书、银行存款证明、经济担保等)。\n \n6、\t\n代办各种产品认证及专利证书,包括ISO9000质量体系认证、CCC强制认证、ISO14000认证、OHSAS18000认证、CE认证、LVD认证、EMC认证、FCC认证、UL认证、各种电信、电子设备的入网证和核准证及检测报告、实用新型及发明专利证书等。\n\n7、\t代办企业年度审计报告、验资报告、资产评估、企业信用等级评估等。\n\n本公司一直以诚信为本、质量第一、全国联网、特快专递，竭诚为大众服务。\n\n公司对外业务联系仅有电子信箱,请大家牢记\n\nQQ客服29080038\nkbanzj@163.com\nkbanzj@yahoo.com.cn\n\n该广告信息是由不受控制系统发布,请勿直接回复此邮件.如有对您造成不便,深感歉意!谢谢!", "from": "代办证件刻章 <fu@QQ.29080038>", "attachments": [], "label": "spam"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/5238", "subject": "● 18岁到23岁，对一个女人来说意味着什么？", "body": "这样的五年，真的可以忽略掉它的影响吗？\n觉得自己好象丧失了爱的能力，再也没有全心全意爱一个人的感觉了。什么都变的无所谓，\n没有大喜，没有大忧。\n只有在晚上看着月亮，想起三年前和一个人也这样看着同一个月亮时，才体会到最痛彻心扉\n的痛。居然才发现自己还是有感觉的。\n一直觉得感情是最重要的，错过了就永远都找不回来了，可惜，只有我一个人这样觉得。\n我不是研究生，我就没有办法给他幸福吗？\n问他：“为什么还相爱，却一定要让我这样痛苦？”\n他告诉我：“因为我想追求我自己的幸福。”\n他说，我是他最深的爱情了，只是，他自己就是这样没心没肺，可以忽略这样的感受。\n我的爱情，原来只有这么重。\n怎么办呢？\n白羊，应该好了伤疤忘了疼啊", "from": "Shaozhi Ye <mo@compass.net.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "spam_sa::sa::spam_2::01377.17adb34fc692245ce301d3db0a3e80c8", "subject": "Thanksgiving Sale", "body": "We want to thank you for your past business and wish you and yours a very Happy Thanksgiving Holiday this year.  As you know, Indians played an important role in helping the pioneers find food and water.  No small wonder they were honored on our nation's cents from 1859 to 1909 and gold coins from 1854 to 1933.   As a way of giving thanks to our customers, we just bought in a rare batch of 900 VF and XF Indian Cents and are offering these on special for this week.  Nice mixture of dates from the 1880s to 1909.   Our regular wholesale price for solid VF coins is $1.95 and $6.00 for solid XF.\nFor this week only, we are offering 10 different dates, VF or better, for only $15 or 10 Different dates, solid XF or better, for only $45.  Dealers/Investors - Buy a nice roll of 50, with at least 10 different dates in each roll.  VF roll of 50, only $69.  XF roll of 50, only $195.  Limit: 5 rolls of each per customer at these low wholesale prices.     \nWe also have some really nice Choice BU (MS 63 or better)  $21/2 Indian Gold coins from 1908-1929 for only $395 each (our choice of date, but we will pick out the best quality) 3 different for only $950 or 10 different for $2,950.  Limit: 10 per customer.  \nPlease add $6 to help with postage and insurance on all orders.  \n\nThank you again,\nCristina\nwww.collectorsinternet.com\nP.S. One of our most popular items this month has been our wholesale \nbargain boxes, found half way down our homepage or at \nhttp://collectorsinternet.com/wholesalebargainbox.htm.  We are getting many \nrepeat orders from other dealers.  You can save time and postage by adding \nthis item, or any other items we have on sale to your other purchases, as \nthere is only a $6 postage and handling fee per order, regardless of size.\n\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\">\n<HTML><HEAD>\n<META http-equiv=Content-Type content=\"text/html; charset=iso-8859-1\">\n<META content=\"MSHTML 6.00.2722.900\" name=GENERATOR>\n<STYLE></STYLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY bgColor=#ffffff>\n<DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>We want to thank you for your past business and \nwish you and yours a very Happy Thanksgiving Holiday this year.&nbsp; As you \nknow, Indians played an important role in helping the pioneers find food and \nwater.&nbsp; No small wonder they were honored on our nation's cents from 1859 \nto 1909 and gold coins from 1854 to 1933.&nbsp;&nbsp; As&nbsp;a way of giving \nthanks to our customers, we just bought in a rare batch of 900&nbsp;VF and XF \nIndian Cents and are offering these on special for this week.&nbsp; Nice mixture \nof dates from the 1880s to 1909.&nbsp;&nbsp; Our regular wholesale price for \nsolid VF coins is $1.95&nbsp;and $6.00 for solid XF.</FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>For this week only, we are offering 10 different \ndates, VF or better,&nbsp;for only $15 or 10 Different dates, solid XF or \nbetter,&nbsp;for only $45.&nbsp; </FONT><FONT face=Arial \nsize=2>Dealers/Investors - Buy a nice roll of 50, with at least 10 different \ndates in each roll.&nbsp; VF roll of 50, only $69.&nbsp; XF roll of 50, only \n$195.&nbsp; Limit:&nbsp;5 rolls of each per customer at these low wholesale \nprices.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; </FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>We also have some really nice&nbsp;Choice BU (MS 63 \nor better) &nbsp;$21/2 Indian Gold coins from 1908-1929&nbsp;for only $395 each \n(our choice of date, but we will pick out the best quality) 3 different for only \n$950 or 10 different for $2,950.&nbsp;&nbsp;Limit: 10 per customer.&nbsp; \n</FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>Please add $6 to help with postage and insurance on \nall orders.&nbsp; </FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>Thank you again,</FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>Cristina</FONT></DIV>\n<DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2><A \nhref=\"http://www.collectorsinternet.com\">www.collectorsinternet.com</A></FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2>P.S. One of our most popular items this month has \nbeen our wholesale <BR>bargain boxes, found half way down our homepage or at \n<BR></FONT><A href=\"http://collectorsinternet.com/wholesalebargainbox.htm\"><FONT \nface=Arial \nsize=2>http://collectorsinternet.com/wholesalebargainbox.htm</FONT></A><FONT \nsize=2><FONT face=Arial>. &nbsp;We are getting many <BR>repeat orders from other \ndealers. &nbsp;You can save time and postage by adding <BR>this item, or any \nother items we have on sale to your other purchases, as <BR>there is only a $6 \npostage and handling fee per order, regardless of size.</FONT> \n</FONT><BR></DIV></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV></FONT></DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial size=2></FONT>&nbsp;</DIV></DIV></BODY></HTML>", "from": "Cristina <cristina@collectorsinternet.com>", "attachments": [], "label": "spam"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/spam/5322", "subject": "地坪施工", "body": "尊敬的先生/小姐\n您好：\n首先感谢您抽时间查看以下信息 \n\n我公司一直致力于研发、生产、销售、施工环氧树脂地坪涂料及防腐工程的高科技企业，以\"用优质材料，做精品工程\" 为经营宗旨来服务社会。\n生产销售：\n环氧树脂系列地坪涂料（底涂、中涂、无溶剂面涂、水性平涂、水性防静电、油性防静电、防菌防霉内墙涂料、自流平水泥、防火涂料、防腐涂料等等），\n台湾生产技术质量保证，价格合理，全程星级服务。\n设计施工：\n环氧树脂系列地坪（环氧平涂、环氧砂浆、环氧自流平、水泥自流平、环氧防静电、PVC地胶板地坪、PVC胶板防静电地坪、金属非金属硬化地面、止滑车道地坪、防腐工程等），专业施工队伍、高效快捷。\n产品特点：\n防尘、防霉防菌、防静电、抗压、抗冲击、防腐，美观耐用，提升企业形象。\n应用领域：\n电子厂、GMP制药厂、食品厂、精密部件厂、办公室、微机室、啤酒厂、光学仪器厂、医院、地下停车场、仓库、纺织厂、印刷厂等车间及天花墙面。\n\n更多详细资料来电咨询备索。\n希望我们的努力，改变您的生活空间，为您的事业成功铺设健康之路！！！\n环氧薄涂地坪\t        三遍\t32.00   四遍\t36.00\n水性环氧亚光滚涂地坪\t三遍\t36.00   四遍\t48.00\n环氧砂浆自流平地坪\t1.0mm\t45.00   2.0mm\t75.00\n\t                3.0mm\t95.00   4.0mm\t105.00\n\t                5.0 mm\t120.00  6.0 mm\t135.00\n\t                7.0 mm\t150.00\n环氧树脂抗静电地坪\t0.6mm\t50.00   1.0mm\t70.00\n\t                1.5mm\t100.00  2.0mm\t115.00\n环氧树脂漆   25元/公斤   能刷9平米\n\n北京公司项目经理：宫艳辉   13701071879", "from": "北京 <tao@tom.com>", "attachments": [], "label": "spam"}
