{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::2523.7b5518a502b8a309e42770179d71626c", "subject": "Words fail me", "body": "URL: http://diveintomark.org/archives/2002/10/10.html#words_fail_me\nDate: 2002-10-10T02:34:18-05:00\n\n_The Morning News_: Rosencrantz & Joshua[1]. Words fail me, which is a rare \nand pleasant gift, thank you. Instead, I will simply take this opportunity to \nquote the original _Rosencrantz & Guildenstern Are Dead_, the excellent \nplay by Tom Stoppard which I keep nestled in my one remaining bookshelf[2] \nbetween the _Tao Te Ching_ and Roald Dahl's _Charlie and the Chocolate Factory_\n. \n\n    Guil: Exactly, it's a matter of asking the right questions and giving away \n    as little as we can. It's a game.\n    Ros: And then we can go?\n    Guil: And receive such thanks as fits a king's remembrance.\n    Ros: I like the sound of that. Waht do you think he meant by remembrance?\n    Guil: He doesn't forget his friends.\n    Ros: Would you care to estimate?\n    Guil: Difficult to say, really&#8212;some kings tend to be amnesiac, others \n    I suppose&#8212;the opposite, whatever that is...\n    Ros: Yes&#8212;but&#8212;\n    Guil: Elephantine... ?\n    Ros: Not how long&#8212;how much?\n    Guil: _Retentive_&#8212;he's a very retentive king, a royal retainer...\n    Ros: What are you playing at?\n    Guil: Words, words. They're all we have to go on. \n\n\n\n\n\n[1] http://www.themorningnews.org/archives/stories/rosencrantz_joshua.shtml\n[2] http://diveintomark.org/archives/2002/04/19.html#alan_cooper_speaks", "from": "diveintomark <rssfeeds@example.com>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "spam_sa::sa::spam_2::00782.1a0cff70694be0ab6f02dbee8b5b482e", "subject": "ADV: Direct email blaster, email addresses extractor, maillist verify, maillist manager...........", "body": "<BODY bgColor=#ffffff>\n<DIV><FONT size=2>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV>\n<DIV><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial size=4>Direct Email \nBlaster</FONT></STRONG> </DIV><FONT size=2>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><B><FONT color=#006600><I>The program will send mail at the \nrate of over 1, 000 e-mails per minute.&nbsp;</I></FONT><BR>Legal and Fast \nsending bulk emails&nbsp;<BR><FONT color=#006600><I>Built in SMTP \nserver&nbsp;</I></FONT><BR>Have Return Path&nbsp;<BR>Can Check Mail \nAddress&nbsp;<BR><FONT color=#006600><I>Make Error Send Address List( Remove or \nSend Again)&nbsp;</I></FONT><BR>Support multi-threads.&nbsp;<BR>Support \nmulti-smtp servers.&nbsp;<BR>Manages your opt-in E-Mail Lists&nbsp;<BR>Offers an \neasy-to-use interface!&nbsp;<BR>Easy to configure and use&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><A \nhref=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/edeb_set.zip\"><STRONG>Download \nNow</STRONG></A></FONT></P>\n<P><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial size=4>Maillist \nVerify</FONT></STRONG></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>Maillist Verify is intended for e-mail addresses and mail \nlists verifying. The main task is to determine which of addresses in the mail \nlist are dead. The program is oriented, basically, on programmers which have \ntheir own mail lists to inform their users about new versions of their \nprograms.</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>The program works on the same algorithm as ISP mail systems \ndo. Mail servers addresses for specified address are extracted from DNS. The \nprogram tries to connect with found SMTP-servers and simulates the sending of \nmessage. It does not come to the message <NOBR>sending &#8255;/NOBR&gt; EMV disconnect \nas soon as mail server informs does this address exist or not. EMV can \nfind</NOBR></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><NOBR>&nbsp;about 90% of dead addresses &#8255;/NOBR&gt; some mail \nsystems receive all messages and only then see their&nbsp;</NOBR></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><NOBR>addresses and if the address is dead send the message \nback with remark about it.</NOBR></FONT></P><NOBR>\n<P><A href=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/bemv_set.zip\"><STRONG><FONT \nface=Arial size=3>Download Now</FONT></STRONG></A></P>\n<P><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial size=4>Express Email \nBlaster&nbsp;</FONT></STRONG></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>Express Email Blaster&nbsp; is a very fast, powerful yet \nsimple to use email sender. Utilizing multiple threads/connections</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;and multiple SMTP servers your emails will be sent out \nfast and easily. There are User Information, Attach Files,&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>Address and Mail Logs four tabbed area for the E-mails \ndetails for sending. About 25 SMTP servers come with the&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>demo version, and users may Add and Delete SMTP servers. \nAbout <FONT color=#008000><B>60,000</B></FONT> E-mails will be sent out per \nhour.\"</FONT></P>\n<P><STRONG><A href=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/beeb_set.zip\"><FONT \nface=Arial size=3>Download Now</FONT></A></STRONG></P>\n<P><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial size=4>Express Email Address \nExtractor</FONT></STRONG></P><FONT size=4>\n<P><FONT color=#008000 size=3>This program is the most efficient, easy to use \nemail address collector available on the </FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><FONT color=#008000 size=3>&nbsp;internet! </FONT><FONT \ncolor=#000000 size=3>Beijing Express Email Address Extractor (ExpressEAE) is \ndesigned to extract</FONT></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT color=#000000 size=3>&nbsp;e-mail addresses from web-pages on the \nInternet (using HTTP protocols) .ExpressEAE</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT color=#000000 size=3>&nbsp;supports operation through many proxy-server \nand works very fast, as it is able of&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT color=#000000 size=3>loading several pages simultaneously, and requires \nvery few resources.</FONT></P>\n<P><FONT color=#000000 face=Arial><FONT size=3>With it, you will be able \nto</FONT><FONT size=2> </FONT><FONT size=3>use targeted searches to crawl the \nworld wide web, extracting&nbsp;</FONT></FONT> \n<P><FONT color=#000000 face=Arial size=3>thousands of clean, fresh email \naddresses. Ably Email address Extractor is unlike other&nbsp;</FONT> \n<P><FONT color=#000000 face=Arial size=3>address collecting programs, which \nlimit you to one or two search engines and are unable</FONT> \n<P><FONT color=#000000 face=Arial size=3>&nbsp;to do auto searches HUGE address. \nMost of them collect a high percentage of incomplete,&nbsp;</FONT> \n<P><FONT color=#000000 face=Arial size=3>unusable addresses which will cause you \nserious problems when using them in a mailing.&nbsp;</FONT> \n<UL>\n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Easier to learn and use than any \n  other email address collector program available.</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Accesses eight search \n  engines&nbsp;</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Add your own URLs to the list to be \n  searched</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial size=3><FONT color=#008000>Supports operation through \n  </FONT><FONT color=#ff00ff>a lot of</FONT><FONT color=#008000> proxy-server \n  and works very fast (HTTP Proxy)</FONT></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Able of loading several pages \n  simultaneously</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Requires very few resources</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Timeout feature allows user to limit \n  the amount of time crawling in dead sites and traps.</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial size=3><FONT color=#008000>Easy to make </FONT><FONT \n  color=#ff00ff>Huge</FONT><FONT color=#008000> address list</FONT></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Pause/continue extraction at any \n  time.</FONT> \n  <LI><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Auto connection to the \n  Internet</FONT> </LI></UL>\n<DIV><STRONG><A href=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/eeae_set.zip\"><FONT \ncolor=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Download Now</FONT></A></STRONG> </DIV>\n<DIV><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial>Express Email Address \nDownloader</FONT></STRONG> </DIV>\n<UL>\n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#006600 size=2>ExpressEAD&nbsp; \n  </FONT><FONT color=#000000 size=2>is a 32 bit Windows Program for e-mail \n  marketing. It is intended for easy and convenient</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#000000 size=2>&nbsp;search large \n  e-mail address lists from mail servers. The program can be operated \n  on&nbsp;</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#000000 size=2>Windows 95/98/ME/2000 \n  and NT.</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#006600 size=2>ExpressEAD&nbsp; \n  </FONT><FONT color=#000000 size=2>support multi-threads (up to 1024 \n  connections).</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#006600 size=2>ExpressEAD&nbsp; \n  </FONT><FONT color=#000000 size=2>has the ability&nbsp; to reconnect to the \n  mail server if the server has disconnected and&nbsp;</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#000000 size=2>continue the searching \n  at the point where it has been interrupted.</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#006600 size=2>ExpressEAD&nbsp; \n  </FONT><FONT color=#000000 size=2>has an ergonomic interface that is easy to \n  set up and simple to use.</FONT></STRONG></FONT> </LI></UL>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial \nsize=4>Features:</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n<UL type=disc>\n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=2>support \n  multi-threads.</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=2>auto get smtp server \n  address,support multi-smtp servers.</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=2>auto save&nbsp; E-Mail \n  Lists</FONT></STRONG></FONT> \n  <LI><FONT face=Arial><STRONG><FONT face=Arial size=2>offers an easy-to-use \n  interface!</FONT></STRONG></FONT> </LI></UL>\n<DIV><STRONG><A href=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/eead_set.zip\"><FONT \ncolor=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Download Now</FONT></A></STRONG> </DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<DIV><STRONG><FONT color=#ff0080 face=Arial>Express Maillist \nManager</FONT></STRONG> </DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<DIV><FONT size=2>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><FONT color=black size=3>This program was designed to be a \ncomplement to the </FONT><FONT color=#800080 size=3>Direct Email Blaster&nbsp; \n</FONT><FONT color=black size=3>and </FONT><FONT color=#800080 size=3>Email \nBlaster </FONT></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><FONT color=black size=3>suite of bulk email software \nprograms. Its purpose is to organize your email lists in order to be \nmore&nbsp;</FONT></FONT></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial><FONT color=black size=3>effective with your email marketing \ncampaign. Some of its features include:</FONT></FONT></P>\n<P><B><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial><FONT size=3>&#8255;Combine several lists into \none file.</FONT><BR><FONT size=3>&#8255;Split up larger lists to make them more \nmanageable.</FONT><BR><FONT size=3>&#8255;Remove addresses from file.</FONT><BR><FONT \nsize=3>&#8255;Manual editing, adding, and deleting of addresses.</FONT><BR><FONT \nsize=3>&#8255;Ability to auto clean lists, that is, remove any duplicate or unwanted \naddresses.</FONT><BR><FONT size=3>&#8255;Maintain all your address lists within the \nprogram so you no&nbsp; longer need to keep all your</FONT></FONT></B></P>\n<P><B><FONT color=#008000 face=Arial size=3>&nbsp;lists saved as separate text \nfiles.</FONT></B></P>\n<P><STRONG><A href=\"http://www.wldinfo.com/bj_download/bemm_set.zip\"><FONT \ncolor=#008000 face=Arial size=3>Download Now</FONT></A></STRONG></P>\n<P><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT></P>\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>if you want to remove your email, please send email to <A \nhref=\"mailto:targetemailremoval@btamail.net.cn\">targetemailremoval@btamail.net.cn</A></FONT> \n</DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<DIV><FONT face=Arial>&nbsp;</FONT> </DIV>\n<DIV>&nbsp;</DIV></FONT></DIV></FONT></NOBR></FONT></FONT></DIV>", "from": "targetemailextractor@btamail.net.cn", "attachments": [], "label": "spam"}
{"id": "trec06c_zip::data/normal/7195", "subject": "● 人过三十两不堪(zz)", "body": "人过三十两不堪\n  \n我是刀子\n    最近接连几个朋友身遭变故。一个离婚，一个被检察院收审，一个患糖尿病。不由得感慨：人过三十两不堪，生不容易死不甘。\n    三者之中，离婚这事大约算件寻常事吧。虽然因为孩子以及财产的分割，一度找了律师写了诉状走到法院门前，但最终还是去民政局协议离婚了――双胞胎的女儿，两套黄金地段的房子，分割起来并不难。聚散无常，谁也不能保证当年的追求是一辈子的承诺，谁也不敢期望自己的幸福生活会延续一生。爱一个人不需要理由，不爱一个人却有千万条理由。喜欢上了别的女人，家中的妻子就怎么看也不够温柔贤惠。好在大家独立谋生，女人一面红肿着眼睛，一面找到一份更高薪的工作。\n    被检察院收审的朋友，案情不详。连单位的十把手都算不上，甚至连拍板定案的权力都微乎其微，只是操作层面的经手人而已，因了数万元的好处费，被立案起诉。很难说其中是不是有替罪羊的成分。但是按照刑法，五千元就足够追究刑事责任了。一大帮曾经愤世嫉俗疾恶如仇口口声声正义感的朋友，现在都道义放两边、把哥们儿摆中间，拐弯抹角托关系，请饭，行贿，弄了一个取保候审。然后又开始打听减轻刑罚的价码。\n    \n    第三位朋友一直是春风得意的。没几年时间就当上了省直外派单位的二把手，却被查出糖尿病，从些药不离口。二十多岁时的便便大腹消失了，人变得很瘦；曾经的一晚上赶三桌饭变作烟酒不沾、清一色素菜；曾经满怀抱负的口若悬河，换上了人到中年的淡然。不再用司机开车，不再训斥下属，不再出入逢迎，只视小女如命。\n    人过三十，父母老了，工作重了，爱情走了，疾病来了。永远有忙不完的事，应付不完的人，永远是没时间去看望父母，没心情去呵护爱情。\n    人过三十，是非中间的分界线开始模糊。接受很多原来不认可的事情，甚至有了很多原来不齿的主张。以为婚外情也没有什么不可以，以为贪污受贿也是人之常情，以为自己这条船不那么容易翻。\n    人过三十，顺风顺水时豪气干云，总想有多少宏图可以施展；一遭重击则心灰意冷，似乎一夜之间顿悟人生真谛，心再无旁鹜，人再无锐意。\n    人过三十，很多东西输不起。\n    人过三十，生不容易死不甘。", "from": "chi <chi@ccert.edu.cn>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
{"id": "spam_sa::sa::easy_ham::0685.1658351aa8cc515f74fb3eee7418d143", "subject": "Re: boycotting yahoo", "body": "On Wed, 18 Sep 2002, Tom wrote:\n\n> The others are on mailing list only status for now. A few of the\n> groups I was in that are run by others are harder to deal with since\n> many folks just dont want to have to deal with the inconvienence of a\n> understanding.\n\nI've terminated a number of my own mailing lists at yahoogroups many\nmonths ago because of similiar sentiments. I've tried lobbying other\npeople to move, but with about zero success.\n\nI've got currently only one own mailing list there, which I'm going to\nmove as soon as it is technically possible (which is my ISP's problem,\nbasically). After that, I intend to kick yahoogroups for good.", "from": "Eugen Leitl <eugen@leitl.org>", "attachments": [], "label": "ham"}
